Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|cmis.repository.type|sharepoint2010|
		|custom.properties|session.store.password=true${line.separator}company.security.auth.type=screenName|
		|osgi.app.includes|sharepoint|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Documents Management|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When these variables
		|sharepointVMHostName|TestPropsUtil#get('cmis.repository.vm.host.name')|
	And AntCommand the value 'clean-sharepoint-repository -Dssh.host=${sharepointVMHostName}' at locator 'build-test-sharepoint.xml'
	And User login PG
		|authenticationMethod|By Screen Name|
		|userScreenName|test|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|Account Settings|
	And User edit Details Via My Account
		|userScreenNameEdit|administrator|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|Account Settings|
	And User edit Password Via My Account
		|currentPassword|test|
		|newPassword|password|
	And User logout PG
	And User login PG
		|authenticationMethod|By Screen Name|
		|password|password|
		|userScreenName|administrator|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMPortlet set Descriptive View
	And DMNavigator goto Add Repository CP
	And DMRepository edit
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMRepository add Sharepoint
		|dmRepositoryLibraryName|Documents|
		|dmRepositorySiteURL|http://${sharepointVMHostName}|
	Then PortletEntry save

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Document
Priority: 4
	Given DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	When DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.txt|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.txt|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.txt|
##########################################################
The Poshi if element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	Then DMDocument view CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.txt|
Scenario: Add Document In Subfolder
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMFolder add Subfolder CP
		|dmSubFolderName|DM Folder2 Name|
	And DMNavigator goto Folder
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder2 Name|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_2.txt|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_2.txt|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMNavigator goto Folder
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder2 Name|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_2.txt|
	Then DMDocument view CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_2.txt|
Scenario: Add Subfolder
Priority: 4
	Given DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	When DMFolder add Subfolder CP
		|dmSubFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	Then DMFolder view CP
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
Scenario: Checkin Document
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPSharepoint#CheckinDocument|
	When DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_3.txt|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_3.txt|
	And Pause at locator '5000'
	And DMDocument checkout CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_3.txt|
		|dmRepositoryName|true|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_3.txt|
	And Pause at locator '5000'
	And DMDocument checkin CP
		|dmRepositoryName|true|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And these variables
		|key_dmDocumentTitle|Document_3.txt|
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'DocumentsAndMedia#ICON_DOCUMENT_ICON_NOT_LOCKED'
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_3.txt|
	Then DMDocument view Checkedin CP
		|dmDocumentVersionNumber|2.0|
		|dmRepositoryName|true|
Scenario: Checkout Document
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPSharepoint#DeleteDocumentInSubfolder|
	When DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_4.txt|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_4.txt|
	And Refresh
	And DMDocument checkout CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_4.txt|
		|dmRepositoryName|true|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMDocument view Icon Locked CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_4.txt|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_4.txt|
	Then DMDocument view Checkedout CP
		|dmRepositoryName|true|
