Scenario: View Edited Checkedout Document
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPSharepoint#ViewEditedCheckedoutDocument|
	When DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.xls|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.xls|
	And DMDocument checkout CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.xls|
		|dmRepositoryName|true|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMNavigator goto Edit Document
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.xls|
	And DMDocument edit Cmd
		|dmDocumentTitleEdit|Document_1_Edit.xls|
	And AssertClick the value 'Save' at locator 'Button#SAVE'
	And Alert view Success Message
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMDocument view Icon Locked CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1_Edit.xls|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1_Edit.xls|
	Then DMDocument view Checkedout CP
		|dmRepositoryName|true|
Scenario: View Original File Extension After Unsuccessful Extension Change
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPSharepoint#ViewOriginalFileExtensionAfterUnsuccessfulExtensionChange|
	When DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.docx|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.docx|
	And DMNavigator goto Edit Document
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.docx|
	And DMDocument edit Cmd
		|dmDocumentTitleEdit|Document_1.jpg|
	And Click at locator 'Button#PUBLISH'
	And Alert view Request Failed To Complete
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'The source file does not have the same extension as the original file.' at locator 'Message#ERROR_2'
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMRepository goto CP
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.docx|
	Then DMDocument view CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.docx|
